{
  "title": "ISic003427. A dedication to Demeter and Kore",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Valentina Mignosa, Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"divine\" data-text=\"Δάματρι\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Δάματρι\">[Δάματ]ρι</span></span> καὶ <span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"divine\" data-text=\"Κόρᾳ\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Κόρᾳ\">Κόρᾳ</span></span>  <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>  <span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Πρωτοφάνεος\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Πρωτοφάνεος\">Π]ρωτοφάνεος</span></span>  <br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]χ̣ος <span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἀρτεμιδώρου\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ἀρτεμιδώρου\">Ἀρτεμιδώρ[ου]</span></span>  <br id=\"al4-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"ρου\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"ρου\"><span data-text=\"ρου\">ρ[ο]υ</span></span></span>  <br id=\"al5-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Valentina Mignosa, Jonathan Prag</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"divine\" data-text=\"Δάματρι\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Δάματρι\">[.....]ΡΙ</span></span>ΚΑΙ<span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"divine\" data-text=\"Κόρᾳ\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Κόρᾳ\">ΚΟΡΑ</span></span><br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Πρωτοφάνεος\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Πρωτοφάνεος\">.]ΡΩΤΟΦΑΝΕΟΣ</span></span><br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>].ΟΣ<span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἀρτεμιδώρου\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ἀρτεμιδώρου\">ΑΡΤΕΜΙΔΩΡ[..]</span></span><br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"ρου\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"ρου\"><span data-text=\"ρου\">Ρ[.]Υ</span></span></span><br id=\"al5-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">5</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2><a href=\"ISic003427_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo Archivio fotografico della Sopraintendenza alle antichita di Siracusa (19962.B, October 1965).\" src=\"ISic003427_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic003427.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo Archivio fotografico della Sopraintendenza alle antichita di Siracusa (19962.B, October 1965).\" src=\"ISic003427-thumb.jpg\"></a></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span>  <span>Text controlled by Prag against photograph</span>  </span>; </li><li><span class=\"3\">3: <span>Gentili 1959-1960, 1961: ΚΟΣ</span></span><br></li><li><span class=\"4\">4: <span>Gentili 1959-1960: [---]ΡΙΟΥ; Gentili 1961: [---]ΩΡΟΥ</span></span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2> translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\">  </p><p>  </p></div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>The stone records a high quality dedication to Demeter and Kore, seemingly by at least three individuals, listed with names and patronymics. From what is preserved of the rear of the block, there was clearly room for at least one more line of text, but perhaps more, since Gentili suggests the base was damaged and perhaps entirely lost - this, as a minimum, likely contained the verb for dedication, but could have included other information, such as the capacity in which the individuals were acting.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Gentili 1959-1960 18-19 </li><li> Gentili 1961 7-8 no.2 dr <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001955\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001955</a></li><li> Manganaro 1965 186 no.1 tav.64 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001841\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001841</a></li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"><p>Broad regular letters of high Hellenistic form with minimal terminal serifs. Alpha has straight bar; Epsilon a slighly shorter middle bar; Kappa has nearly full length arms (but slightly variable); Mu has vertical outer strokes, half length inner strokes; omicron is almost full size; Sigma has parallel outer strokes; Phi has slightly extended vertical; Omega is full size, slightly ovoid, and almost closed.</p> Line 1-4  20  Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. </div>",
